      "source": "JSON reading and writing can be customized by configuring a <a href=\"JacksonObjectReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JacksonObjectReader</code></a> and\n<a href=\"JacksonObjectWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JacksonObjectWriter</code></a>.",
