    {
      "source": "<a href=\"GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializer.GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializerBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializer.GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializerBuilder</code></a> wraps around a <code>JsonMapper.Builder</code> providing dedicated\nmethods to configure aspects like <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/support/NullValue.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.support\"><code>NullValue</code></a> serialization strategy for the resulting <code>ObjectMapper</code>\nto be used with <a href=\"GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializer</code></a> as well as potential Object/<a href=\"JacksonObjectReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>-reader</code></a> and <a href=\"JacksonObjectWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>-writer</code></a> settings.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializer.GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializerBuilder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializer.GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializerBuilder</code></a> 封装了一个 <code>JsonMapper.Builder</code>，提供专门的方法用于配置结果 <code>ObjectMapper</code> 的各个方面，例如针对与 <a href=\"GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>GenericJacksonJsonRedisSerializer</code></a> 一起使用的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/support/NullValue.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.support\"><code>NullValue</code></a> 序列化策略，以及潜在的 Object/<a href=\"JacksonObjectReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>-reader</code></a> 和 <a href=\"JacksonObjectWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>-writer</code></a> 设置。",
      "count": 1
    },
