    {
      "source": "<code>type</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> from which the JSON will be deserialized; must not be\n         null.",
      "translation": "<code>type</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> 类型，即 JSON 反序列化所源自的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> 类型；不得为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>reader</code> - the <a href=\"JacksonObjectReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JacksonObjectReader</code></a> function to read objects using <code>ObjectMapper</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>reader</code> - 使用 <code>ObjectMapper</code> 读取对象的 <a href=\"JacksonObjectReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JacksonObjectReader</code></a> 函数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>writer</code> - the <a href=\"JacksonObjectWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JacksonObjectWriter</code></a> function to write objects using <code>ObjectMapper</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>writer</code> - 使用 <code>ObjectMapper</code> 通过 <a href=\"JacksonObjectWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JacksonObjectWriter</code></a> 接口来写入对象的函数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "null for an empty source, or an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> of the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> deserialized from\n        the array of bytes containing JSON.",
      "translation": "如果源为空，则返回 null；否则，返回从包含 JSON 的字节数组反序列化得到的给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
